---
layout: layouts/program.njk
title: Who Are the Teams?
description: Explore ASCEND's growing network of student teams, university pod leads, subject matter experts, and project leadership.
permalink: /teams/
eyebrow: A growing network for discovery
teamsMap: true
---
<section aria-labelledby="teams-map-heading">
<h2 id="teams-map-heading">Our network, on the map</h2>
<p id="teams-map-help">Select a marker to see the institution, its role, and the people supporting ASCEND. The gold-ring ASCEND badge marks the principal investigator at Montana State University. Stars mark pod leads, diamonds mark subject matter experts, a square marks the major co-investigator, and dots mark student teams. Nearby locations are grouped under a number; select it to see each institution, or zoom in. You can also choose an institution from the list below.</p>
<div class="teams-map-toolbar" data-pagefind-ignore>
<div class="teams-map-legend" aria-label="Map legend"><span class="teams-map-key"><img class="team-pi-badge" src="/assets/teams/ascend-pi-badge.svg" width="28" height="28" alt=""> Principal investigator</span><span class="teams-map-key"><span class="team-symbol team-symbol-team" aria-hidden="true">●</span> Student team</span><span class="teams-map-key"><span class="team-symbol team-symbol-pod" aria-hidden="true">★</span> Pod lead</span><span class="teams-map-key"><span class="team-symbol team-symbol-sme" aria-hidden="true">◆</span> Subject matter expert</span><span class="teams-map-key"><span class="team-symbol team-symbol-leadership" aria-hidden="true">■</span> Major co-investigator</span></div>
<button class="button outline" id="teams-map-reset" type="button" hidden>Show all locations</button>
</div>
<div id="teams-map" class="teams-map" role="region" aria-label="ASCEND teams, pod leads, and subject matter experts map" aria-describedby="teams-map-help" hidden></div>
<p id="teams-map-status" class="small" role="status" data-pagefind-ignore></p>
<noscript><p>The interactive map needs JavaScript. Participating institutions are also listed below.</p></noscript>
<p class="small teams-location-note">Markers show approximate campus or research center locations. As student teams join ASCEND, their dots will be added to the network.</p>
{% if not teams.length %}<div class="teams-empty"><h3>The network starts here</h3><p>Our directory is getting started. As institutions join ASCEND, their locations will appear on this map and in the list below.</p></div>{% endif %}
</section>
<section class="teams-directory-section" aria-labelledby="teams-directory-heading">
<h2 id="teams-directory-heading">Institutions & people</h2>
<p>{% if teams.length %}{{ teams.length }} network location{% if teams.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}, listed alphabetically.{% else %}Participating institutions will be listed here as teams join.{% endif %}</p>
<ul id="teams-directory" class="teams-directory">
{% for team in teams %}<li id="team-{{ team.id }}" data-team-id="{{ team.id }}" data-kind="{{ team.kind }}" data-latitude="{{ team.latitude }}" data-longitude="{{ team.longitude }}">
<p class="team-role">{% if team.id == 'montana-state' %}<img class="team-pi-badge" src="/assets/teams/ascend-pi-badge.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="">{% else %}<span class="team-symbol team-symbol-{{ team.kind }}" aria-hidden="true">{% if team.kind == 'pod' %}★{% elif team.kind == 'sme' %}◆{% elif team.kind == 'leadership' %}■{% else %}●{% endif %}</span>{% endif %} {{ team.role }}</p>
<h3 class="team-institution">{{ team.institution }}</h3>
<p class="team-location">{{ team.city }}, {{ team.state }}</p>
{% if team.person %}<p class="team-person">{{ team.person }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if team.profileId %}<a class="team-profile-link" href="/leadership/#{{ team.profileId }}">Read biography<span class="visually-hidden">: {{ team.person }}</span></a>{% endif %}
<button type="button" class="team-map-link" hidden>Show on map<span class="visually-hidden">: {{ team.institution }}</span></button>
</li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
</section>
<p>Learn <a href="/project/">how teams and pods work together</a>, or meet the <a href="/leadership/">ASCEND leadership team</a>.</p>
